[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13921.349, "timestamp": "03:52:01", "text": "えっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13935.75, "timestamp": "03:52:15", "text": "中に入れてください。じゃあ、最後のやつで行こう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13937.59, "timestamp": "03:52:17", "text": "1つ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13941.11, "timestamp": "03:52:21", "text": "そしてこれはスパンとなる。私たちは複製します"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13943.429, "timestamp": "03:52:23", "text": "2つのスパン。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13946.63, "timestamp": "03:52:26", "text": "こいつを削除しろ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13959.03, "timestamp": "03:52:39", "text": "ええと、1 つのスパンには"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13966.309, "timestamp": "03:52:46", "text": "うん。だから私はこうしようと思った"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13970.55, "timestamp": "03:52:50", "text": "それをOとして入れると、入れることができません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13975.189, "timestamp": "03:52:55", "text": "O.H 待って"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13978.15, "timestamp": "03:52:58", "text": "料理させてください。"}]